    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ded2e4fe0dc0aa83",
      "translationZh": "探索支撑我们编程智能体和终端用户界面（TUI）的运行框架。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "362668fd3d48bd0e",
      "translationZh": "在 GitHub 上查看 试用 Grok Build",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18aaac111995a2ae",
      "translationZh": "我们正在将 SpaceXAI 的编程智能体和终端用户界面（TUI）Grok Build 开源。源代码现已在 GitHub 上发布。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a92b7ee00cdedded",
      "translationZh": "公开代码是打造稳健、可靠的运行框架最直接的方式。你可以阅读源代码，确切了解它从上下文组装到工具调用分发的运作方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70de22e2f1de13cf",
      "translationZh": "开源也让这个运行框架更易于探索和扩展：如果你正在使用技能、插件、钩子、MCP 服务器或子智能体，源代码就是了解它们各自如何被加载和调用的权威参考。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58004cfe3d818df3",
      "translationZh": "最后，Grok Build 现在可以完全以本地优先的方式运行：自行编译，将其指向你自己的本地推理服务，并通过 config.toml 驱动一切。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f21e977db6219ce",
      "translationZh": "已发布的源代码包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "963696f4d0350ffe",
      "translationZh": "智能体循环：如何组装上下文、解析模型响应以及分派工具调用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "46d26acd04634a00",
      "translationZh": "工具：智能体如何读取、编辑和搜索代码，以及如何运行命令",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8a5fe1f073715319",
